## Topology / Naming Clarification

- This layer does not relocate canonical terminal GTValidator.
- This layer is not the canonical post-Executor/Post V&V GTValidator.
- Canonical GTValidator remains after Executor/Post V&V and before Root FinalOutput.
- This layer is a pre-Architect candidate-level advisory review over AVF-ranked DRS candidates.
- It may emit GT-style advisory signals, but those signals are not Root Final, not action permission, and not direct reuse permission.
- It returns advisory signals to Root/Orchestrator route decision.
- It must not command Architect directly.
- Architect must receive only Root-shaped tasks/routes, not commands from DRS/AVF/advisory evaluator.
- Human-facing alias may be: AVF Candidate Advisory Evaluator.
- Internal module name remains `hedgehog/gt_lgt_advisory_evaluator.py` for this checkpoint.
- LGT is deferred/local placeholder only.
- No concrete production LGT runtime/schema/test exists.
- Root remains final authority.

