Authority boundary conclusion:

GT/LGT Advisory Evaluator v0.1 is a candidate-level advisory evaluator over
AVF-ranked DRS candidates. It does not relocate canonical GTValidator and does
not command Architect. GT-style signals and LGT deferred/local placeholder
signals may inform Root/Orchestrator route review, but they do not become truth,
Root Final, direct reuse permission, action permission, FinalOutput, or
production GT/LGT behavior. Root remains final authority.
